{"text": "Simpleton picked up the goose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And went to an inn. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For the night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The innkeeper had three daughters. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they saw the goose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Each girl wanted. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To take a golden feather. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For herself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The oldest girl touched the goose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But her hand stuck to it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The second and third girls tried, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And they also stuck. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Simpleton walked away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With the goose under his arm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The three girls were running. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Behind him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But they could not let go. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a field. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A parson saw them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And became angry. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Shame on you, girls. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why are you running. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After this young man. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He took the youngest girls hand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he stuck, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon the sexton. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And two farm workers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Got stuck, too.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "i", "m", "p", "l", "e", "t", "o", "n", " ", "p", "i", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "u", "p", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "o", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "w", "e", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "n", " ", "i", "n", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "F", "o", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0",